  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "特殊路径：不耗 attempts 的跳批",
      "items": [
        "主密钥不可用：整批跳过，不碰行、不耗 attempts、保持 PENDING，密钥配好即恢复流动（WebhookDeliveryRelay:70-76，决策号 S1-c）",
        "毒行异常：catch 后按普通失败走退避或终态，不再每 2s 被重选阻塞同批（WebhookDeliveryRelay:78-87，决策号 N7）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "mark 三语句全带 PENDING 守卫（与 Outbox 差异）",
      "items": [
        "markSent/markRetry/markFailed 三条全带 AND status='PENDING'（WebhookDeliveryMapper:28/:33/:38）",
        "对照组 OutboxMapper 同名三语句只 WHERE id，无守卫（OutboxMapper:19-27）",
        "差异根源（推断）：relay 轮询、手工重放、聚合冲刷多触发源碰同一行，条件更新收敛恰好一次；outbox 写者唯一"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "双时钟口径",
      "items": [
        "next_attempt_at：写 DATE_ADD(NOW())、比较 <=NOW()，全 DB 时钟（WebhookDeliveryMapper:14-19、:31-35）",
        "sent_at：markSent #{now} 由 Relay 按 JVM 时钟写入（WebhookDeliveryRelay:136）；业务列误用 NOW() 会「早 8 小时」",
        "SENT 清理：cutoff 由调用方按 JVM 时钟算好传入（WebhookDeliveryMapper:41-49、SentRowCleanup:61-65）",
        "退避 min(1h,10·2^n) 首次 20s（markRetry 写 DATE_ADD(NOW())）：20/40/80/160/320/640/1280s，8 次共约 42 分钟；1h 上限为调大 max-attempts 兜底（Relay:163-164）",
        "SSRF blocked 的日志刻意不回显解析地址与内因，防探测扫描（WebhookDeliveryRelay:104-106，D-C4-8）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "「4 类出口」与手工重放（行号）",
      "items": [
        "attempts≥8：第 8 次失败即终态，含毒行、解密失败耗尽（WebhookDeliveryRelay:154-161）",
        "其他 4xx 首败：401/403/404/410… 明确拒绝，重试无意义（WebhookDeliveryRelay:142-146）",
        "endpoint 缺失/disabled：last_error=endpoint disabled（WebhookDeliveryRelay:91-96）",
        "SSRF 违规：last_error=blocked target，日志不回显内因（WebhookDeliveryRelay:100-107，D-C4-8）",
        "手工重放：SQL UPDATE 回 PENDING；eventId 跨重试与重放稳定（WebhookDelivery.java:23-24，D-Bw2-12）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "AGGREGATE digest 行同一条状态机",
      "items": [
        "digest 行同样 PENDING 起步，event_id=digest-{endpointId}-{windowStart}[-partN]（WebhookAggregateFlusher:165-166）",
        "与逐条行同表、同 relay、同签名、同重试，是 C1 决策（D-C1-18..25）的核心省法",
        "删除带缓冲 endpoint：discardBufferedOnDelete 直接写 FAILED 留痕，last_error=endpoint deleted with pending aggregate buffer（WebhookAggregateFlusher:46、:128-133）；FAILED 不被 relay 捞，不发送"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
